<report>
<line><title>Risk difference meta-analysis</title></line>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Table (exposed +ve, control +ve, exposed -ve, control -ve)</u><block name="inputs"></td></tr>
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>a</in></td><td><in>b</in></td><td><in>c</in></td><td><in>d</in></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></block></td></tr>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Risk difference</th><th><ci><in>pc</in>% CI (<in>method</in>)</ci></u><block name="differences"></td></tr>
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>rd</in></td><td><ci><in>lci</in></td><td><in>uci</in></td><td></ci><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></block></td></tr>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><th>% Weights (fixed, random)</u><block name="differences"></td></tr>
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>yi</in></td><td><in>vi</in></td><td><in>wt</in></td><td><in>dwt</in></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></block></td></tr>
</table>
<line></line>
<line><u>Fixed effects (Mantel-Haenszel, Greenland-Robins)</u></line>
<line>Pooled risk difference = <in>rmh</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci>)</line>
<line>Chi&#xb2; (test risk difference differs from 0) = <in>x2</in>  (df = <in>df</in>)  <pval><in>xp</in></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Non-combinability of studies</u></line>
<line>Cochran Q = <in>qc</in>  (df = <in>df_cochran</in>)  <pval><in>xp_cochran</in></pval></line>
<line>Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <in>tausq</in></line>
<line>I&#xb2; (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>) </line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u></line>
<line>Pooled risk difference = <in>dsrd</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>dsll</in> to <in>dsul</in></ci>)</line>
<line>Chi&#xb2; (test risk difference differs from 0) = <in>dsx2</in>  (df = <in>df_ds</in>)  <pval><in>xp_ds</in></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Bias indicators</u><block name="egger"></line>
<line>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><in>p2</in></pval></line>
<line>Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><in>p</in></block></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line></line>
</report>
